  "description": "<p>Testsuite test failed</p>\n<div class='table-wrap'>\n<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#acl-representation\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">5.2-C</a></td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>MUST</td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>FAIL</td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>Implementations must use only statements associated with an authorization in the ACL RDF to determine access, except in the case of acl:agentGroup statements where the group listing document is dereferenced.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n\n\n<p>Spec reference: <a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#acl-representation\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#acl-representation</a></p>\n\n<p>For help running the test suite: </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FF/Fedora+API+Specification+Test+Suite\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FF/Fedora+API+Specification+Test+Suite</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>",
